     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "dialog"
    },
    {
     "start": 16.5,
     "end": 18.0,
     "text": "이걸 본 여성은",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 18.0,
     "end": 21.0,
     "text": "직접 실험해 보겠다며 립을 바르더니",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 18.1,
     "end": 21.2,
     "text": "We're going to test out. Okay, I got my ramen.",
     "speaker": "S4",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "dialog"
    },
    {
     "start": 21.0,
     "end": 23.2,
     "text": "먹방을 시작하는데요.",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 23.5,
     "end": 27.8,
     "text": "I think it did a pretty good job. No touch ups needed. It passed the test.",
     "speaker": "S4",
